<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Inland Steel cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Inland Steel cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers downgraded Inland Steel Industries Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Inland lost 1/2 to 24-7/8.</p>
</text>
